    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/27d4d8c2ed9ae0f69841c0068a006507.poster.avif?t=1715683364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/27d4d8c2ed9ae0f69841c0068a006507.webm?t=1715683364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>In <strong>Crunky's Fun Rager</strong>, you play as <strong>Crunky</strong>, a bouncy energetic bunny seeking revenge against the mischievous <strong>Crunko Pops</strong>. Your goal? Keep Crunky hopping, dodge obstacles, and defeat enemies. Jump on Crunko Pops to squash them or collect power-ups that grant Crunky unique abilities.<br><br>Aim for high scores in order to top the <strong>Daily Leaderboard</strong>, complete <strong>Achievements</strong> for a completionist experience, and track your <strong>Stats</strong> along the way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/gameplay_01.gif?t=1715683364\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/text-challenges.gif?t=1715683364\" /></span><br><br>Navigate <strong>trampolines</strong>, leverage <strong>knives</strong>, <strong>guns</strong>, and <strong>vehicles</strong> to take down enemies, collect <strong>red coins</strong> and protecting <strong>balloons</strong>. Each <strong>challenge</strong> completed earns Crunky a <strong>letter</strong>, and collecting 2 letters brings you to the next area.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/gameplay_02.gif?t=1715683364\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/text-areas.gif?t=1715683364\" /></span><br><br>Crunky\u2019s adventure starts in the sunny <strong>Crunkopolis Plains</strong>. Collecting the first 2 letters will bring you to the <strong>Crumpy Desert</strong>, where things start to heat up a bit. After collecting 2 more letters you will find yourself in the <strong>Cropular Underground</strong> before 2 more letters brings you to the forgotten <strong>Frunky Fields</strong>...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/6f7d5ca353082da737e49ec3ac305140.poster.avif?t=1715683364\" width=640 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/6f7d5ca353082da737e49ec3ac305140.webm?t=1715683364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/6f7d5ca353082da737e49ec3ac305140.mp4?t=1715683364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/0d4af43d56f73fd3131e17dad29492bd.poster.avif?t=1715683364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/0d4af43d56f73fd3131e17dad29492bd.webm?t=1715683364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/30c217fb1058c1f78cf1c25c11f57173.poster.avif?t=1715683364\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/30c217fb1058c1f78cf1c25c11f57173.apng?t=1715683364\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=128 /></picture></span><br><br>There are tons of wacky and zany <strong>Crunko Pops</strong> for you to encounter in Crunkoland, each with their own unique behaviours, and some only found in certain areas at certain times... Killing 100 of each will add their entry to the <strong>Michaelnomicon</strong> in your <strong>Crunkipedia</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/text-crunky-pass.gif?t=1715683364\" width=600 height=128 /></span><br><br>Want to support the game and snag some fun cosmetics for Crunky? Check out the <strong>Crunky Pass DLC</strong>! Get 14 exclusive <strong>outfits/hats/accessories</strong> to customize Crunky\u2019s appearance which can also be seen by your friends on the <strong>Daily Leaderboards</strong>.",
