?t=1715683364\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=128 /></picture></span><br><br>There are tons of wacky and zany <strong>Crunko Pops</strong> for you to encounter in Crunkoland, each with their own unique behaviours, and some only found in certain areas at certain times... Killing 100 of each will add their entry to the <strong>Michaelnomicon</strong> in your <strong>Crunkipedia</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567730/extras/text-crunky-pass.gif?t=1715683364\" width=600 height=128 /></span><br><br>Want to support the game and snag some fun cosmetics for Crunky? Check out the <strong>Crunky Pass DLC</strong>! Get 14 exclusive <strong>outfits/hats/accessories</strong> to customize Crunky\u2019s appearance which can also be seen by your friends on the <strong>Daily Leaderboards</strong>.",
